{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_10_level_main_10-02_end","groupId":"main_10","stageId":"main_10-02","title":"低下頭","storyCode":"10-3","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_10-02_end.txt","sourceHash":"dcd45ae1298a019b8ea7b8969cbd0702783f0673c7ab2fa4f217459dd51dd9cf","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g2_inexport"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，這樣下去，托馬斯先生又會落到深池的人手裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是不是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這幫煩人精！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我這就去把人撈回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幹嘛抓著我？這人不是我們救回來的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"情況不同。我們不能讓推進之王暴露在這些敵人面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你讓我們把人丟了不管？這可不是我們格拉斯哥幫的作風！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們兩個，別在這裡吵架。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維娜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......聽博士和阿米婭的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"狙擊幹員，瞄準挾持目標的敵人！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"那個術師是關鍵。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"術師......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我想起來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根據Misery的消息和風笛的報告，她就是倫蒂尼姆這支深池部隊的頭目。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也是小丘郡事件的始作俑者之一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島並不打算把Outcast的犧牲完全怪罪在她一個人頭上，但不光Misery和風笛，我們許多幹員都對她抱有強烈的敵意。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"蔓德拉。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"風笛說，她很難纏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們可以在這裡和深池作戰，救回托馬斯先生，甚至排除蔓德拉這個對之後的行動有重大威脅的勁敵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲士兵來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......來不及了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各小組注意，繼續隱藏自己的位置——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做好隨時戰鬥的準備。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g15_customs"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這邊怎麼回事？鬧哄哄的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，我當是誰，原來是你們這些叛國者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別用那個詞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們和維多利亞沒關係了，魔族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那——又是誰允許你對我們用這個稱呼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......一群被驅逐的烏合之眾，只不過是趁著混亂占了別人的城市，就妄想自己是倫蒂尼姆的主人了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，你以為我跟你們似的，真在乎什麼倫蒂尼姆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡是挺乾淨亮堂的，對吧？也沒什麼死亡帶來的臭氣。但要我說，這座城市還不如變成廢墟之後才更順眼些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲在這裡，只是因為魔王在這裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g2_inexport"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......魔王？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"他們說的是特雷西斯？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"攝政王終於忍不住給自己加冕了？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我們還沒收到與之相關的情報。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，無數情報指向一個已知的事實，曾經遍佈泰拉的薩卡茲戰士正在往倫蒂尼姆聚集，而且受到召集的不止有我們熟悉的普通雇傭兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一些更古老的......更強大的力量正盤桓在這座城市的中心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我能感覺到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在來到這附近以後，隨著我們一步步走近，那些流進我心底......也纏繞在我思緒裡的情感躁動了起來，它們正在變得更加強烈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米婭！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你還好吧？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒事，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是......在剛才那一瞬間......我好像......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在聽到這些薩卡茲戰士稱呼“君主”的時候，那些情感......中的一縷，它彈跳了起來，輕輕抓了我一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道該如何更確切地形容這種感受......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我們需要談談。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也願意花更多時間與博士交談......可不能是現在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即便真的有一位......薩卡茲的君主控制著如今的倫蒂尼姆，這也不會改變我們的使命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們來這裡，是為了阻止一場戰爭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們要弄清楚他們正在做什麼，最終又準備做什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——這與特雷西斯為自己選擇什麼稱謂沒有關係。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g15_customs"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我們裹屍布似的又臭又長的相互問候結束了嗎，深池？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把你們抓著的這個人交出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"憑什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就憑我們管著你祖上老家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"住手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"長官......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不光是你。薩卡茲，我也在叫你住手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你，菲林，你是他們的指揮官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我為什麼要聽你的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為我曾經去過聖王會西部大堂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，我們都聽說了，你想見殿下，但殿下叫人把你趕了出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還真以為你在薩卡茲眼裡算個什麼東西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"長官，我們憑什麼要受這些魔族的侮辱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我受不了了，自從來了倫蒂尼姆，我們天天要在這些劣等種......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別說了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們明明可以回去找領袖......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我叫你別說了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲，無論你怎麼激我，我都不會從這裡離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是薩卡茲的客人，這是你們的殿下還有殿下近臣親口承認過的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真想知道我們薩卡茲是如何對待不聽話的“客人”的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們之中至少有一方還懂點禮貌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們答應了你們的王和將軍，深池的部隊不會踏足倫蒂尼姆中央城區。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"與此同時，你們也不該在這攔住我，薩卡茲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是說你們魔族從來就背信棄義，不知道“守約”兩個字怎麼寫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，徒有其表的菲林......我沒在這裡砍死你，不是因為我得了什麼命令要跟你們做朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是一個薩卡茲吵著架就忘了目標是什麼，那他一定早就死在了戰場之外的酒吧裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是來這追查一些不聽話的陰溝蟲豸的，這些不自量力的小東西眼下就躲在附近，給我們的工作四處添亂——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g2_inexport"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽起來，薩卡茲要找的也不是托馬斯先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道是信使女士提到過的，能為我們的行動提供幫助的朋友？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是他們的話，的確會被薩卡茲當作敵人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是他們真的就在這裡，我們或許能幫他們一把......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g15_customs"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人群停止移動了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽見了爭執聲......薩卡茲士兵和什麼人起了衝突。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民？","speakerId":"avg_npc_413_1","isRemote":false,"text":"中尉，我看到了那些人的制服......是深池！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民？","speakerId":"avg_npc_413_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是說那個深池的術師？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民？","speakerId":"avg_npc_413_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她......她很可怕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民？","speakerId":"avg_npc_413_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們之中好幾個人死在她手裡。她會把人串在不知從哪冒出來的石柱上，她的手段比薩卡茲還狠！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民？","speakerId":"avg_npc_413_1","isRemote":false,"text":"中尉，您也對付過她？瞧我說的......您從深池手裡救了這麼多人，您一定擊敗過她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我輸了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民？","speakerId":"avg_npc_413_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那您......您從她手裡活了下來，這已經很了不起了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不清楚為何她沒有立刻殺了我......我有過一些猜想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在倫蒂尼姆外的軍營裡，我察覺到他們與一位伯爵的信使有過數次秘密會面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，這資訊是她有意透露給我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......又或許並不是她。她那樣的人，無從獲知我的祖父與那位伯爵的父親曾是親密戰友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而伯爵本人......如果我沒有記錯的話，他曾是一位公爵的扈從。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民？","speakerId":"avg_npc_413_1","isRemote":false,"text":"中尉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我不該在你們面前說這些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有很長一段時間躲在城市的......暗處，習慣了與無法開口的水道磐蟹為伍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些時候，我不必在意自己話語的回音是否會給別人蒙上陰翳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是需要把有些話說出來，以免自己忘記。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民？","speakerId":"avg_npc_413_1","isRemote":false,"text":"中尉，我不是阻攔您開口的意思！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民？","speakerId":"avg_npc_413_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我甚至希望您能多說一些，我早就想知道，到底是誰高高在上地操控著這一切，把我們害成這樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我腦海中的那位公爵，他此刻並不在倫蒂尼姆。甚至說......他似乎從未屬意過這城中空置的王座。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果他就是深池背後的支持者，那麼很多問題都有了解答，可與此同時，我們眼前的危局也將更難解......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽好。無論我之前說了什麼，都還只是一些不成形的猜測。你們還想聽的話，我們可以換個場合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......只要你們到時候依然願意跟隨我踏進陰影裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民？","speakerId":"avg_npc_413_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那現在呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在——我們需要找到一個脫身的時機。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"深池一直想從薩卡茲手裡找到什麼，或許是一個或者幾個人，所以才在薩迪恩區建了那麼多處據點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了像你們這樣被薩卡茲追捕的士兵，他們還抓走了很多與薩卡茲有關的平民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管蔓德拉到底有什麼目的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要深池和薩卡茲發生衝突，對我們都是有利的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民？","speakerId":"avg_npc_413_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽起來您已經有一個計畫了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅本，我給你的手弩你有沒有好好藏在袖子裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民？","speakerId":"avg_npc_413_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，中尉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瞄準離薩卡茲最近的那個深池士兵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g2_inexport"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看樣子，深池不會後退。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲的耐心很有限，他們之間的衝突一觸即發。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我們要啟動備用計畫了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g15_customs"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，把你們手裡的人交出來，要不然就老實點死在我們手上——給彼此一個痛快，不好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......長官，我們是不是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不明白......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說不行就是不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕這會導致我們和薩卡茲關係破裂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你聽到他們的話了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們......什麼時候做過朋友？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這才對嘛，這可是你說的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——列隊！圍住這些深池軟蛋！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個人，深池非要不可。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"實在帶不走他的話，我們只能在這裡殺了他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閉嘴，吵死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不然把這幾個薩卡茲也都殺了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g2_inexport"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是該輪到我們登場了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等一下，空中座標還在校準。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看啊，再不動手的話，那個人就要被殺了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"馬上......直線距離十七米......十六米......十五米......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最好再近一點，不然你很難瞄準吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行呀，再靠近會被發現的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽我的，絕對不會失敗，不然我把頭給你當釘子敲——你讓它往東偏一點，剛好光線反射會遮掉機翼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，就是現在！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——洛克五號，攻擊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g15_customs"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是時候了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅本，動手！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g15_customs"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃呃呃——啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔呃......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們暗算我們？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說什麼呢？先放暗箭的難道不是你們——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還擊！還擊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"染上薩卡茲血的人，只能用更多的血來償還！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這裡的人，一個都別放過！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"記住，是你們先動的手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——上吧，殺了所有在場的薩卡茲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不能讓他們活著回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天在這裡發生的一切，絕不能讓領頭的魔族知道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊啊——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"救命，救命！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，這些平民無處可逃......不光托馬斯先生，前面好多人都還在他們的交戰範圍裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲和深池都不會管平民的死活！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，阿米婭，抱歉，我不能就這麼看著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我做不到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"沒有其他選擇了。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"全體幹員注意，行動目標——變更！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"非作戰人員繼續保持隱蔽，作戰人員在保證安全的情況下，救人！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......有箭從後面射過來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是那些穿著平民衣服的人......他們攜帶著違禁武器！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不對勁，升降梯那裡還躲著更多敵人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......我們抓到那群蟲豸的尾巴了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡果然有反抗軍——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"立刻去通報曼弗雷德將軍！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
